#: templates/whispers/about.html:9
msgid "About psst-secret"
msgstr "Om psst-secret"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:10
msgid ""
"A privacy focused app for sharing secrets securely. We call them whispers."
msgstr ""
"En integritetsfokuserad app för att dela hemligheter säkert. Vi kallar dem "
"whispers."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:15
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "Så fungerar det"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:17
msgid ""
"psst-secret ensures that <strong class=\"text-white\">your whispers never "
"exist in plaintext on our server</strong>. All encryption and decryption "
"happens entirely in your browser using the <a href=\"https://developer."
"mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Crypto_API\" class=\"text-brand-400 "
"underline hover:text-brand-300\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Web Crypto API</a>."
msgstr ""
"psst-secret säkerställer att <strong class=\"text-white\">dina whispers "
"aldrig finns i klartext på vår server</strong>. All kryptering och "
"dekryptering sker helt i din webbläsare med hjälp av <a href=\"https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Crypto_API\" class=\"text-"
"brand-400 underline hover:text-brand-300\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Web Crypto API</a>."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:19
msgid "Send Mode"
msgstr "Sändningsläge"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:20
msgid ""
"Share a whisper with someone. The key travels only inside the link you share."
msgstr ""
"Dela en whisper med någon. Nyckeln följer endast med i länken du delar."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:23
msgid "Creating a Whisper"
msgstr "Skapa en whisper"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:25
msgid "You type your whisper in the browser"
msgstr "Du skriver din whisper i webbläsaren"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:26
msgid ""
"A random <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">AES-256-GCM</strong> key is "
"generated client-side"
msgstr ""
"En slumpmässig <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">AES-256-GCM</strong>-nyckel "
"skapas på klientsidan"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:27
msgid "Your whisper is encrypted in-browser"
msgstr "Din whisper krypteras i webbläsaren"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:28
msgid "Only the <em>ciphertext</em> is sent to the server"
msgstr "Endast <em>chiffertexten</em> skickas till servern"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:29
msgid ""
"The decryption key is placed in the URL fragment (<code class=\"text-"
"brand-300\">#key</code>)"
msgstr ""
"Dekrypteringsnyckeln placeras i URL-fragmentet (<code class=\"text-"
"brand-300\">#key</code>)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:33
msgid "Viewing a Whisper"
msgstr "Visa en whisper"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:35
msgid "You open the shared link"
msgstr "Du öppnar den delade länken"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:36
msgid "The server returns the ciphertext"
msgstr "Servern returnerar chiffertexten"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:37
msgid "The key from the URL fragment decrypts it in-browser"
msgstr "Nyckeln i URL-fragmentet dekrypterar den i webbläsaren"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:38
msgid "You see the plaintext — the server never does"
msgstr "Du ser klartexten — servern gör det aldrig"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:42
msgid ""
"Send mode uses only symmetric encryption (<strong class='text-"
"gray-200'>AES-256-GCM</strong>), which is not broken by quantum computers. "
"The known quantum attack on symmetric ciphers (Grover's algorithm) at most "
"halves the effective key strength, leaving 128 bits — still far beyond "
"reach. Shor's algorithm, the real quantum threat, only affects public-key "
"cryptography, which send mode does not use."
msgstr ""
"Sändningsläget använder endast symmetrisk kryptering (<strong class='text-"
"gray-200'>AES-256-GCM</strong>), som inte knäcks av kvantdatorer. Den kända "
"kvantattacken mot symmetriska chiffer (Grovers algoritm) halverar som mest "
"den effektiva nyckelstyrkan till 128 bitar — fortfarande långt utom "
"räckhåll. Shors algoritm, det verkliga kvanthotet, påverkar endast "
"kryptografi med publika nycklar, som sändningsläget inte använder."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:44
msgid "Receive Mode"
msgstr "Mottagningsläge"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:45
msgid ""
"Ask someone to send a whisper <em>to you</em>. Receive mode uses public-key "
"encryption, so the person submitting can encrypt but never decrypt."
msgstr ""
"Be någon skicka en whisper <em>till dig</em>. Mottagningsläget använder "
"kryptering med publika nycklar, så den som skickar kan kryptera men aldrig "
"dekryptera."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:48
msgid "Creating a Request"
msgstr "Skapa en förfrågan"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:50
msgid ""
"Your browser generates a key pair using <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">X-"
"Wing</strong>, a hybrid of <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">ML-KEM-768</"
"strong> (post-quantum, FIPS 203) and <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">X25519</"
"strong>"
msgstr ""
"Din webbläsare skapar ett nyckelpar med <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">X-"
"Wing</strong>, en hybrid av <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">ML-KEM-768</"
"strong> (postkvant, FIPS 203) och <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">X25519</"
"strong>"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:51
msgid ""
"The public key is stored on the server. The submit link contains only its "
"fingerprint, so the server cannot swap in a key of its own"
msgstr ""
"Den publika nyckeln lagras på servern. Inlämningslänken innehåller endast "
"dess fingeravtryck, så servern kan inte byta ut den mot en egen nyckel"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:52
msgid ""
"The private key seed stays in your view link fragment (or is encrypted with "
"your password)"
msgstr ""
"Fröet till den privata nyckeln stannar i visningslänkens fragment (eller "
"krypteras med ditt lösenord)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:53
msgid "You share the submit link and keep the view link"
msgstr "Du delar inlämningslänken och behåller visningslänken"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:57
msgid "Submitting & Viewing"
msgstr "Skicka in och visa"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:59
msgid "The sender opens the submit link and types their whisper"
msgstr "Avsändaren öppnar inlämningslänken och skriver sin whisper"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:60
msgid ""
"The sender's browser encrypts to your public key and uploads only the "
"ciphertext"
msgstr ""
"Avsändarens webbläsare krypterar med din publika nyckel och laddar endast "
"upp chiffertexten"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:61
msgid "You open your view link"
msgstr "Du öppnar din visningslänk"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:62
msgid "Only your view link can decrypt it"
msgstr "Endast din visningslänk kan dekryptera den"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:66
msgid ""
"The submit link and view link use different identifiers. Someone who gets "
"hold of the submit link cannot find, read, or burn the submitted whisper."
msgstr ""
"Inlämningslänken och visningslänken använder olika identifierare. Den som "
"får tag på inlämningslänken kan inte hitta, läsa eller radera den inskickade "
"whispern."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:67
msgid ""
"Because the key exchange is hybrid, the whisper stays protected as long as "
"either algorithm holds — including against attackers who record traffic "
"today and hope to decrypt it with a quantum computer later."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom nyckelutbytet är en hybrid förblir whispern skyddad så länge minst "
"en av algoritmerna är säker — även mot angripare som spelar in trafik i dag "
"och hoppas kunna dekryptera den med en kvantdator senare."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:73
msgid "Why the URL Fragment?"
msgstr "Varför URL-fragmentet?"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:75
msgid ""
"The decryption key is stored after the <code class='bg-gray-900 px-1.5 "
"py-0.5 rounded text-brand-300'>#</code> in the URL, known as the fragment. "
"The URI specification (<a href='https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/"
"rfc3986#section-3.5' class='text-brand-400 underline hover:text-brand-300' "
"target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>RFC 3986 §3.5</a>) reserves the "
"fragment for processing by the browser, and the HTTP specification (<a "
"href='https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110#section-7.1' class='text-"
"brand-400 underline hover:text-brand-300' target='_blank' rel='noopener "
"noreferrer'>RFC 9110 §7.1</a>) excludes it from the request — so <strong "
"class='text-white'>the URL fragment is never sent to the server</strong>. "
"This means:"
msgstr ""
"Dekrypteringsnyckeln lagras efter <code class='bg-gray-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 "
"rounded text-brand-300'>#</code> i URL:en, i det så kallade fragmentet. URI-"
"specifikationen (<a href='https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/"
"rfc3986#section-3.5' class='text-brand-400 underline hover:text-brand-300' "
"target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>RFC 3986 §3.5</a>) reserverar "
"fragmentet för behandling i webbläsaren, och HTTP-specifikationen (<a "
"href='https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110#section-7.1' class='text-"
"brand-400 underline hover:text-brand-300' target='_blank' rel='noopener "
"noreferrer'>RFC 9110 §7.1</a>) utesluter det från begäran — så <strong "
"class='text-white'>URL-fragmentet skickas aldrig till servern</strong>. Det "
"innebär att:"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:77
msgid "The server never receives the decryption key"
msgstr "Servern aldrig tar emot dekrypteringsnyckeln"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:78
msgid "The key doesn't appear in server logs or analytics"
msgstr "Nyckeln inte förekommer i serverloggar eller analysdata"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:79
msgid "Even if the server is compromised, your whispers remain encrypted"
msgstr "Dina whispers förblir krypterade även om servern komprometteras"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:86
msgid "Password Protection"
msgstr "Lösenordsskydd"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:88
msgid ""
"Optionally, you can set a password when creating a whisper. When a password "
"is used:"
msgstr ""
"Du kan välja att ange ett lösenord när du skapar en whisper. När ett "
"lösenord används:"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:90
msgid ""
"The encryption key is derived from your password using <strong class=\"text-"
"gray-200\">PBKDF2</strong> (600,000 iterations, SHA-256)"
msgstr ""
"Härleds krypteringsnyckeln från ditt lösenord med <strong class=\"text-"
"gray-200\">PBKDF2</strong> (600 000 iterationer, SHA-256)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:91
msgid ""
"A random <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">salt</strong> is generated and "
"stored on the server (useless without the password)"
msgstr ""
"Skapas ett slumpmässigt <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">salt</strong> som "
"lagras på servern (oanvändbar utan lösenordet)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:92
msgid ""
"The URL contains <em>no key fragment</em> — only the password holder can "
"decrypt"
msgstr ""
"Innehåller URL:en <em>inget nyckelfragment</em> — endast den som har "
"lösenordet kan dekryptera"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:93
msgid ""
"For receive requests, the password protects your private key instead. The "
"sender does not need it — only you do, to open the view link"
msgstr ""
"Skyddar lösenordet i stället din privata nyckel vid "
"mottagningsförfrågningar. Avsändaren behöver det inte — bara du behöver det "
"för att öppna visningslänken"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:94
msgid "This provides an extra layer of security for highly sensitive data"
msgstr "Detta ger ett extra säkerhetslager för mycket känsliga uppgifter"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:101
msgid "Security Features"
msgstr "Säkerhetsfunktioner"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:104
msgid "Burn After Reading"
msgstr "Radera efter läsning"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:106
msgid ""
"Whispers marked as burn-after-read are <strong class=\"text-"
"gray-300\">permanently deleted</strong> the moment they are viewed — not "
"just flagged, but gone."
msgstr ""
"Whispers som ska raderas efter läsning <strong class=\"text-"
"gray-300\">raderas permanent</strong> så snart de visas — de markeras inte "
"bara, utan försvinner helt."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:108
msgid ""
"Whispers marked as burn-after-read are <strong class=\"text-"
"gray-300\">permanently erased from memory</strong> the moment they are "
"viewed — not just flagged, but gone."
msgstr ""
"Whispers som ska raderas efter läsning <strong class=\"text-"
"gray-300\">raderas permanent ur minnet</strong> så snart de visas — de "
"markeras inte bara, utan försvinner helt."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:112
msgid "Auto-Expiry"
msgstr "Automatisk utgångstid"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:113
msgid ""
"All whispers require an expiration time (5 minutes to 1 month). Expired "
"whispers are automatically evicted from Redis via TTL and continuously "
"purged by a background process."
msgstr ""
"Alla whispers måste ha en giltighetstid (5 minuter till 1 månad). Whispers "
"vars giltighetstid har löpt ut tas automatiskt bort från Redis via TTL och "
"rensas löpande av en bakgrundsprocess."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:117
msgid ""
"Industry-standard authenticated encryption. Provides both confidentiality "
"and integrity — any tampering with the ciphertext is detected."
msgstr ""
"Autentiserad kryptering enligt branschstandard. Ger både konfidentialitet "
"och integritet — all manipulering av chiffertexten upptäcks."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:120
msgid "Post-Quantum Ready"
msgstr "Redo för kvantdatorer"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:121
msgid ""
"Send mode uses 256-bit symmetric keys, which remain secure against quantum "
"computers. Receive mode uses the hybrid ML-KEM-768 + X25519 key exchange."
msgstr ""
"Sändningsläget använder 256-bitars symmetriska nycklar, som förblir säkra "
"mot kvantdatorer. Mottagningsläget använder det hybrida nyckelutbytet ML-"
"KEM-768 + X25519."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:124
msgid "Zero Knowledge"
msgstr "Ingen insyn"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:126
msgid ""
"The server stores only encrypted data and public key material in Redis. It "
"has no ability to decrypt your data, even under compulsion."
msgstr ""
"Servern lagrar endast krypterade data och publikt nyckelmaterial i Redis. "
"Den kan inte dekryptera dina data, inte ens under tvång."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:128
msgid ""
"The server stores only encrypted data and public key material — and only in "
"volatile memory (Redis). It has no ability to decrypt your data, even under "
"compulsion."
msgstr ""
"Servern lagrar endast krypterade data och publikt nyckelmaterial — och bara "
"i flyktigt minne (Redis). Den kan inte dekryptera dina data, inte ens under "
"tvång."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:136
msgid "What the Server Stores"
msgstr "Vad servern lagrar"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:140
msgid "Redis (with persistence enabled)"
msgstr "Redis (med beständig lagring aktiverad)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:142
msgid "Redis (in-memory only — never touches disk)"
msgstr "Redis (endast i minnet — skrivs aldrig till disk)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:147 templates/whispers/about.html:167
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Fält"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:148 templates/whispers/about.html:168
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Syfte"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:152
msgid "Your encrypted data (useless without the key)"
msgstr "Dina krypterade data (oanvändbara utan nyckeln)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:153
msgid "Random initialization vector for AES-GCM"
msgstr "Slumpmässig initieringsvektor för AES-GCM"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:154
msgid "PBKDF2 salt (only if password-protected)"
msgstr "PBKDF2-salt (endast vid lösenordsskydd)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:155
msgid "Receive mode: your X-Wing public key (can only encrypt)"
msgstr "Mottagningsläge: din publika X-Wing-nyckel (kan endast kryptera)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:156
msgid ""
"Receive mode: the sender's key encapsulation (useless without your private "
"key)"
msgstr ""
"Mottagningsläge: avsändarens nyckelinkapsling (oanvändbar utan din privata "
"nyckel)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:157
msgid ""
"Receive mode: your private key seed encrypted with your password (only if "
"password-protected)"
msgstr ""
"Mottagningsläge: fröet till din privata nyckel krypterat med ditt lösenord "
"(endast vid lösenordsskydd)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:158
msgid "Reveal counter, used to enforce the view limit"
msgstr "Visningsräknare som används för att upprätthålla visningsgränsen"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:163
msgid "PostgreSQL (metadata only)"
msgstr "PostgreSQL (endast metadata)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:172
msgid "Random identifier used in the view link"
msgstr "Slumpmässig identifierare som används i visningslänken"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:173
msgid "Receive mode: separate random identifier used in the submit link"
msgstr ""
"Mottagningsläge: separat slumpmässig identifierare som används i "
"inlämningslänken"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:174
msgid "When the whisper was created and when it will be auto-deleted"
msgstr "När whispern skapades och när den kommer att raderas automatiskt"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:175
msgid "Number of allowed reveals before destruction (1 = burn; 0 = unlimited)"
msgstr ""
"Antal tillåtna visningar före radering (1 = radera efter läsning; 0 = "
"obegränsat)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:176
msgid "Send or receive"
msgstr "Sända eller ta emot"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:177
msgid "IP/CIDR restriction"
msgstr "IP/CIDR-begränsning"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:178
msgid "Whether signing in is required to view or submit"
msgstr "Om inloggning krävs för att visa eller skicka in"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:179
msgid "Email address to notify (only if you opt in)"
msgstr "E-postadress för aviseringar (endast om du väljer det)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:184
msgid ""
"The server does <strong>not</strong> store: plaintext, encryption keys, "
"private keys, or passwords. An email address is only stored if you opt in to "
"notifications. Encrypted data is stored in Redis with persistence enabled."
msgstr ""
"Servern lagrar <strong>inte</strong> klartext, krypteringsnycklar, privata "
"nycklar eller lösenord. En e-postadress lagras endast om du väljer att få "
"aviseringar. Krypterade data lagras i Redis med beständig lagring aktiverad."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:186
msgid ""
"The server does <strong>not</strong> store: plaintext, encryption keys, "
"private keys, or passwords. An email address is only stored if you opt in to "
"notifications. Encrypted data lives only in volatile memory and is lost if "
"Redis restarts."
msgstr ""
"Servern lagrar <strong>inte</strong> klartext, krypteringsnycklar, privata "
"nycklar eller lösenord. En e-postadress lagras endast om du väljer att få "
"aviseringar. Krypterade data finns bara i flyktigt minne och går förlorade "
"om Redis startas om."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:193
msgid "Tech Stack"
msgstr "Teknikstack"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:197
msgid "Redis (persistent)"
msgstr "Redis (beständig lagring)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:199
msgid "Redis (in-memory)"
msgstr "Redis (i minnet)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:214
msgid "Create a whisper"
msgstr "Skapa en whisper"

#: templates/whispers/burned.html:4
msgid "Whisper Burned"
msgstr "Whisper raderad"

#: templates/whispers/burned.html:9
msgid "This whisper has been burned"
msgstr "Denna whisper har raderats"

#: templates/whispers/burned.html:10
msgid ""
"This was a burn-after-reading whisper and has already been viewed. It no "
"longer exists."
msgstr ""
"Denna whisper skulle raderas efter läsning och har redan visats. Den finns "
"inte längre."

#: templates/whispers/burned.html:12 templates/whispers/expired.html:12
msgid "Create a new whisper"
msgstr "Skapa en ny whisper"

#: templates/whispers/confirm.html:4
msgid "Reveal Whisper"
msgstr "Visa whisper"

#: templates/whispers/confirm.html:10
msgid "Burn-after-reading whisper"
msgstr "Whisper som raderas efter läsning"

#: templates/whispers/confirm.html:11
msgid ""
"This whisper will be permanently destroyed after you view it. Click below "
"when you are ready."
msgstr ""
"Denna whisper raderas permanent när du har visat den. Klicka nedan när du är "
"redo."

#: templates/whispers/confirm.html:14 templates/whispers/confirm.html:18
#: templates/whispers/view.html:4
msgid "View Whisper"
msgstr "Visa whisper"

#: templates/whispers/confirm.html:15
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This whisper can be viewed up to %(n)s times in total before it is "
"destroyed. Click below to reveal it."
msgstr ""
"Denna whisper kan visas upp till %(n)s gånger totalt innan den raderas. "
"Klicka nedan för att visa den."

#: templates/whispers/confirm.html:19
msgid "Click below to decrypt and view this whisper."
msgstr "Klicka nedan för att dekryptera och visa denna whisper."

#: templates/whispers/confirm.html:25
msgid "Reveal whisper"
msgstr "Visa whisper"

#: templates/whispers/confirm.html:34
msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "Laddar…"

#: templates/whispers/create.html:4
msgid "New Whisper"
msgstr "Ny whisper"

#: templates/whispers/create.html:9
msgid "Share a whisper"
msgstr "Dela en whisper"

#: templates/whispers/create.html:10
msgid ""
"Your content is encrypted in your browser before it reaches our server. We "
"never see your plaintext."
msgstr ""
"Ditt innehåll krypteras i din webbläsare innan det når vår server. Vi ser "
"aldrig din klartext."

#: templates/whispers/create.html:17
msgid "Send"
msgstr "Skicka"

#: templates/whispers/create.html:21
msgid "Receive"
msgstr "Ta emot"

#: templates/whispers/create.html:30 templates/whispers/submit.html:18
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Text"

